// spec: RT-003
//
// Length measures TEXT.  A collection has a count and it is a property, so
// asking Length for one is refused rather than answered with the length of its
// rendering -- which used to be 12 for a List of three, where L.Length is 3.
// A plausible number rather than an error.

WriteLn (Length ('abc'));
WriteLn (Length ('a'));
WriteLn ([10, 20, 30].Length);

WriteLn (Length ([10, 20, 30]));
